    {
      "subId": "7150201",
      "subQuestName": "Talk to Hosseini",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "715020101"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "715020101": {
            "id": "715020101",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Hosseini",
            "text": "You're here.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "715020102"
            ]
          },
          "715020102": {
            "id": "715020102",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Yup, we're here to help!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "715020103"
            ]
          },
          "715020103": {
            "id": "715020103",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Hosseini",
            "text": "I was just checking the Pursina's Spike. I must say that Liyue's miners are made of stern stuff. Just two of them were enough to transport the Spike here.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "715020104"
            ]
          },
          "715020104": {
            "id": "715020104",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Hosseini",
            "text": "But since the Spike has some very fine moving parts, I need to check if it has been affected while in transit. In theory, though, everything should be fine.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "715020105"
            ]
          },
          "715020105": {
            "id": "715020105",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "#That's what you said the last time, too, and you nearly got Paimon and {NICKNAME} into deep trouble!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "715020106"
            ]
          },
          "715020106": {
            "id": "715020106",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Hosseini",
            "text": "*cough* Well, I did also say that there is a difference between theory and reality. However, I made sure to check everything before you came.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "715020107"
            ]
          },
          "715020107": {
            "id": "715020107",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Hosseini",
            "text": "Everything has been prepared, and once initialized and in operation, the Spike will not need any initial elemental energy input to maintain its charging state.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "715020110"
            ]
          },
          "715020110": {
            "id": "715020110",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Hosseini",
            "text": "Yes. Before, I had to adapt it to Inazuma's environment, and so I modified it such that it could only charge and operate through the use of Electro.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "715020111"
            ]
          },
          "715020111": {
            "id": "715020111",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Hosseini",
            "text": "However, that is not the original operating mode of the Pursina's Spike.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "715020112"
            ]
          },
          "715020112": {
            "id": "715020112",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Hosseini",
            "text": "Originally, it was intended to function in this sort of environment. In fact, this dark mud is its power source.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "715020113"
            ]
          },
          "715020113": {
            "id": "715020113",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "The mud provides power to the Spike?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "715020114"
            ]
          },
          "715020114": {
            "id": "715020114",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Hosseini",
            "text": "That's right, and that's why the Spike is perfectly suited to solving this issue.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "715020115"
            ]
          },
          "715020115": {
            "id": "715020115",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Hosseini",
            "text": "If you consider it, this dark mud issue we're having in The Chasm has both \"symptom\" and \"source,\" both of which must be resolved.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "715020116"
            ]
          },
          "715020116": {
            "id": "715020116",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Hosseini",
            "text": "Of these, the \"source\" is..."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7150202",
      "subQuestName": "Activate the Pursina's Spike",
      "sceneId": null,
